% References for the swim pacing optimization project.
%
% VERIFICATION STATUS. Every entry here was confirmed to exist through a search
% or a fetched page. None was reconstructed from memory. The `note` field on
% each entry records how far verification got:
%
%   [full text read]  the full text was fetched and read
%   [abstract only]   the abstract was read; full text not accessed
%   [metadata only]   existence and bibliographic details confirmed via Crossref
%                     or equivalent, but the publisher page was blocked
%
% Numbers quoted from [abstract only] and [metadata only] sources must be
% checked against the PDF before they appear in the paper.
%
% COVERAGE IS PARTIAL. This search covered swimming hydrodynamics and
% energetics. Exercise physiology (VO2 kinetics, anaerobic capacity, critical
% speed), observed pacing, start and turn contributions, and mathematical
% performance models are NOT yet covered. Parameters depending on those areas
% are marked PROVENANCE GAP in docs/parameters.md.

